   "key": "scene_01",
   "text": "Hansi Flick has a problem. Injuries have hit his defence, so Frenkie de Jong, a midfielder, will start at centre-back, with Eric García at right-back. Spotify Camp Nou, Barcelona. Barça lead La Liga after this round, with 12 wins in 13 games, and Flick has promised attacking football. Then, at minute 5, Villarreal score. At minute 7, they score again. Two goals in 7 minutes. What went wrong at the back, and was Barça already beaten?",
