  {
   "key": "scene_02",
   "text": "Before kick-off, the absences. Barça were without Rodri and 3 more injured players. Villarreal had 4 injured, among them Ilias Akhomach. Form was mixed. Barça had lost to PSG and Real Madrid, then won 3 in a row. Villarreal had lost 6-0 to PSG, then beaten Getafe 2-0. Hansi Flick, before the game, on nine matches in 27 days: \"We have a good squad and we need to manage playing time.\" Íñigo Pérez had a different plan. According to Comuniate, he wanted Villarreal to press high, and said defending deep at Camp Nou would not be comfortable.",
