  {
   "key": "scene_03",
   "text": "Flick arrived in May 2024 to replace Xavi. At his presentation, reported by CGTN, he promised \"all possession and really attacking football.\" Our reading: that promise leans on the back line. Tonight that line has a midfielder at its centre, Frenkie de Jong, with Eric García at right-back. If it cracks, the whole idea is exposed. Ahead of them, Lamine Yamal, the most valuable starter on the pitch at 221 million euros. He is the one asked to make that risk pay.",
