  {
   "key": "scene_04",
   "text": "Minute 5. Fermín López gives the ball away, and Tajon Buchanan scores from distance with his right foot. Minute 7. A fast break, and Tani Oluwaseyi finishes with his left. Two shots, two goals. Early on, it looks like Pérez's plan is working. Then the match tilts. FotMob's momentum graph has Barça on top for 77 percent of the first half. Minute 21, Yamal goes down under a challenge from Oluwaseyi. Play goes on, until VAR sends the referee to the monitor. Penalty. Yamal hits the post. Half-time: 0-2.",
