  {
   "key": "scene_08",
   "text": "Flick, to ESPN: \"We took too long with the ball, made two mistakes and they scored two goals.\" Then the referee. Fermín, already substituted, protested when no penalty was given for a challenge on Anthony Gordon. The referee's report says he sent Fermín off from the bench at minute 74, and Fermín left before the card was shown. Flick: \"We always have this sort of problem with this referee.\" Barça plan to appeal. Archivo VAR, a site that rates referees, gave him 2.5 out of 10, but says the Yamal penalty was correct.",
